ng updated?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Rarely. Last significant update was 2022. Flipmine is legacy; Ecom Circles ships new features monthly."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I export from Flipmine to Ecom Circles?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Export as CSV from Flipmine, then import to Ecom Circles. We help with onboarding (30-min setup call)."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Ecom Circles support eBay like Flipmine?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Not yet, but coming in Q2 2026. Right now: Amazon, Walmart, Mirakl, Shopify supported."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What if I only need basic inventory sync?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Even basic sync is better on Ecom Circles because our platform syncs automatically and support is responsive."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Flipmine cheaper?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes upfront. Flipmine $10-$50/mo; Ecom Circles starts $27/mo. But with repricer + inventory, Ecom Circles becomes better value."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How long does switch take?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"30-60 minutes. We import inventory, reconnect channels, configure repricing. Zero downtime."}}]}</script><section class="pgx-33 bg-shades"><div class="pgx-34"><div class="pgx-35"><h1 class="pgx-36 font-satoshi">Ecom Circles vs Flipmine: Complete Comparison for Sellers</h1><p class="pgx-37">Platform features, marketplace support, development status, and pricing. Updated 2026.</p><div class="pgx-38"><a class="pgx-39" href="#features">See Feature Matrix<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="pgx-3 lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a class="pgx-40" href="contact.php">Switch to Ecom Circles</a></div></div></div></section><section class="pgx-41 bg-shades"><div class="pgx-42"><p class="pgx-43">Flipmine was an early multi-marketplace seller tool. For years, it was solid, affordable, simple, and it worked for multi-channel sellers. But the platform hasn&#x27;t evolved. Updates are rare. New features don&#x27;t arrive. Meanwhile, Amazon and Walmart have changed dramatically. If you&#x27;re using Flipmine in 2026, you&#x27;re probably wondering: Is it still the right platform? Or is it time to switch?</p></div></section><section class="pgx-49 bg-shades" id="features"><div class="pgx-34"><div class="pgx-50"><h2 class="pgx-51 font-satoshi">Feature-by-Feature Comparison</h2></div><div class="pgx-302"><table class="pgx-76 pgx-663"><thead><tr class="pgx-303"><th class="pgx-304">Feature</th><th class="pgx-304">Flipmine</th><th class="pgx-304">Ecom Circles</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="pgx-305"><td class="pgx-306">Platform Status</td><td class="pgx-307">Legacy/minimal updates</td><td class="pgx-308">✓ Actively developed</td></tr><tr class="pgx-309"><td class="pgx-306">Amazon Support</td><td class="pgx-307">Yes, basic</td><td class="pgx-308">✓ Full + AI insights</td></tr><tr class="pgx-305"><td class="pgx-306">Walmart Support</td><td class="pgx-307">Limited</td><td class="pgx-308">✓ Full native integration</td></tr><tr class="pgx-309"><td class="pgx-306">eBay Support</td><td class="pgx-307">Yes</td><td class="pgx-308">Coming Q2 2026</td></tr><tr class="pgx-305"><td class="pgx-306">Shopify Integration</td><td class="pgx-307">Basic sync</td><td class="pgx-308">✓ Full integration</td></tr><tr class="pgx-309"><td class="pgx-306">Repricer</td><td class="pgx-307">No</td><td class="pgx-308">✓ Yes, integrated</td></tr><tr class="pgx-305"><td class="pgx-306">Inventory Management</td><td class="pgx-307">Manual CSV</td><td class="pgx-308">✓ Automatic sync</td></tr><tr class="pgx-309"><td class="pgx-306">Sourcing/Scanner</td><td class="pgx-307">No</td><td class="pgx-308">✓ Yes</td></tr><tr class="pgx-305"><td class="pgx-306">Warehouse Services</td><td class="pgx-307">No</td><td class="pgx-308">✓ Yes (FBA prep, returns)</td></tr><tr class="pgx-309"><td class="pgx-306">Account Management (DFY)</td><td class="pgx-307">No</td><td class="pgx-308">✓ Yes</td></tr><tr class="pgx-305"><td class="pgx-306">Multi-User Support</td><td class="pgx-307">Limited</td><td class="pgx-308">✓ Full (1-10 users)</td></tr><tr class="pgx-309"><td class="pgx-306">Mobile App</td><td class="pgx-307">Basic</td><td class="pgx-308">✓ Full app</td></tr><tr class="pgx-305"><td class="pgx-306">Support Quality</td><td class="pgx-307">Email only, slow</td><td class="pgx-308">✓ Email + chat support</td></tr><tr class="pgx-309"><td class="pgx-306">Price/Month</td><td class="pgx-307">$10-$50</td><td class="pgx-308">$27-$297 (full platform)</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class="pgx-57 bg-shades"><div class="pgx-34"><div class="pgx-50"><h2 class="pgx-51 font-satoshi">Why Sellers Switch From Flipmine to Ecom Circles</h2></div><div class="pgx-310"><div class="pgx-58"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Active Development</h3><p class="pgx-1">Ecom Circles ships monthly features. Flipmine updates rarely. If waiting for new features on Flipmine, you&#x27;ll be waiting forever.</p></div><div class="pgx-58"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Walmart Support That Works</h3><p class="pgx-1">Flipmine&#x27;s Walmart is basic. Ecom Circles built Walmart from ground up. SPS monitoring, item-level management, bulk scanning. All native.</p></div><div class="pgx-58"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Integrated Sourcing &amp; Repricer</h3><p class="pgx-1">Flipmine has neither. Ecom Circles includes both. Scan items, calculate profit, set repricing, track inventory. All in one platform.</p></div><div class="pgx-58"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Real Profit Tracking</h3><p class="pgx-1">Flipmine shows per-order profit. Ecom Circles tracks by channel, supplier, SKU. You see exactly where margins come from.</p></div><div class="pgx-58"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Warehouse &amp; Fulfillment</h3><p class="pgx-1">Flipmine is software-only. Ecom Circles offers integrated warehousing (FBA prep, WFS prep, 2-step dropshipping).</p></div><div class="pgx-58"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Better Account Management</h3><p class="pgx-1">Flipmine doesn&#x27;t manage accounts. Ecom Circles does. We can handle your account full-time (DFY) or just oversee.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="pgx-49 bg-shades"><div class="pgx-42"><h2 class="pgx-311 font-satoshi">Which Platform for Your Business?</h2><div class="pgx-24"><div class="pgx-312"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Casual Multi-Channel Tester</h3><p class="pgx-1">Flipmine would work IF still developed. Since it&#x27;s not, use Ecom Circles ($27/mo). More features, real support.</p></div><div class="pgx-312"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Serious Amazon + Walmart Seller</h3><p class="pgx-1">Use Ecom Circles. Flipmine&#x27;s Walmart is too basic. Ecom Circles monitors SPS, handles repricing, tracks margins across channels.</p></div><div class="pgx-312"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Wholesale Buyer (10K+)</h3><p class="pgx-1">Use Ecom Circles. Flipmine can sync CSVs but can&#x27;t scan wholesale or forecast profits. Ecom Circles handles both.</p></div><div class="pgx-312"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Dropshipping (Shopify + Marketplaces)</h3><p class="pgx-1">Use Ecom Circles. Flipmine doesn&#x27;t handle Shopify well. Ecom Circles integrates fully with Shopify, syncs automatically.</p></div><div class="pgx-312"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Just Testing (Budget-Conscious)</h3><p class="pgx-1">Flipmine might be cheaper. But you&#x27;ll outgrow it in 3 months. Ecom Circles is one platform for growth.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="pgx-313 bg-shades"><div class="pgx-42"><div><h2 class="pg-h2 pg-mb-8">The Ecom Circles Advantage: One Platform, Complete Control</h2><div class="pgx-10"><p>Once your inventory is synced across Amazon and Walmart, automate your pricing. <a class="pgx-314" href="repricer.php">Our integrated repricer</a> adjusts prices based on competition, inventory levels, and your margin targets. No more manual updates. No more spreadsheets. Just smart repricing that maximizes profit.</p><p>Then manage your orders from one unified inbox. <a class="pgx-314" href="order-management.php">Order management in Ecom Circles</a> pulls every order from every channel into one dashboard. Process fulfillment faster. Reduce errors. Keep customers happy. Flipmine doesn&#x27;t offer this at all. You&#x27;re juggling Seller Central and Walmart Manager.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="pgx-57 bg-shades"><div class="pgx-42"><h2 class="pgx-311 font-satoshi">Flipmine vs Ecom Circles FAQs</h2><div><div><div class="pg-faq__item"><button class="pg-faq__btn"><span class="pg-faq__q">Is Flipmine still being updated?</span><span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down pg-faq__chev" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class="pg-faq__item"><button class="pg-faq__btn"><span class="pg-faq__q">Can I export from Flipmine to Ecom Circles?</span><span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down pg-faq__chev" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class="pg-faq__item"><button class="pg-faq__btn"><span class="pg-faq__q">Does Ecom Circles support eBay like Flipmine?</span><span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-line